        {"type": "outlet_t_range", "unit_tag_pattern": "HT", "T_min_K": 355, "T_max_K": 400}
      ]
    },
    "notes": "Canonical two-unit heat+flash regression. VLE at 100°C for BT gives ~50% vapour."
